[null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["田园杂诗二首 其二","何景明","五言长篇",["去官今七暑，渐与农务亲。","随宜谙土性，言话群野人。","时或溯微风，行歌响空榛。","先民邈何扳，慨焉伤我神。","慨伤遹谁知，所有三二宾。","文论日往来，烱烱高义申。","炎雨回众壑，凉飙起修畛。","兀然林木下，日人忘归轮。","玄蝉夕益聒，去鸟一何频。","野行畏多露，无使侵衣巾。"],0,"x268","明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["子夜歌　六首","李孙宸","五言长篇",["门外马蹄响，窥帘日瞩欢。","不知欢见否，空遗气若兰。","芙蓉种横浦，绿叶初田田。","一心望成藕，一心望见莲。","侬发初覆肩，含羞与郎好。","所急岂少年，白头誓相保。","欢负侬已多，岂不念侬故。","侬心不怨欢，欢被傍人误。","侬似江上山，日日立江中。","欢心江流水，晨西夕又东。","一自别欢来，无心种花药。","但种黄蘖生，苦心得相托。"],0,"x308","明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["五君咏 陈汝大","徐熥","五言长篇",["汝大长者流，涉世嗟不偶。","玄牝有精诣，黄庭能自守。","混迹居泥途，飘然出尘垢。","作赋馀万言，读书穷二酉。","振响主词盟，伊余忝其后。","非博生前名，所志在不朽。","汝翔好奇古，遁迹在柯屿。","词藻何离离，才情尤楚楚。","能追正始音，不作齐梁语。","臭味既已同，素心自相许。","睽乖劳我思，山中正延伫。","平夫貌不扬，意气何卓荦。","耻抱齐门竽，甘作荆山璞。","诗解匡生颐，谈折充宗角。","一饮动百巡，贤圣分清浊。","古道信寡谐，正音久辽邈。","努力崇令名，典籍有先觉。","伯孺秉异姿，弱冠富经籍。","拓落守太玄，异同辨坚白。","作赋已驰名，耽奇自成癖。","丹青发妙赏，磊磊生泉石。","把臂结词盟，微悰永无斁。","荐夫意气豪，逢人作白眼。","冥心契道诠，矢志稽坟典。","伯仲既齐名，君才良不忝。","大雅久沉沦，俯仰知音鲜。","凌厉向词坛，片语人矜善。","结志在千秋，令名尔当勉。"],0,"x291","明"],null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,null,["卷六 出塞二首","张元凯","五言长篇",["赤帜空邻壁，朱麾满汉营。","受降当夜半，飞捷入春明。","赐锦麟裁就，悬金鹊化成。","玺书频慰劳，天子重干城。","列骑猎飞狐，龙城出虎符。","宝刀寒太白，绣甲卷天吴。","都尉称强弩，将军字破奴。","控弦三十万，踊跃取休屠。"],0,"x321","明"]]